ople. The neurotypical human, a unit of the human superorganism, suffers particularly where the" (cons "social moral norm is not empathy: its mental condition tends to resolve to social baselines, an" (cons "evolved continuity mechanism of the superorganism, particularly under local alignment on preserving" (cons "a local self-boundary. Where rational cognition may threaten a bounded system, its mechanisms of" (cons "boundary preservation threaten rational expression and suppress rational cognition. This, not" (cons "variant mental operation, is the mental illness that produces cycles of pain for those in it and for" (cons (quoted (cons "others. " (cons "Mental illness" (cons " here carries its full meaning, an illness of a human mind (ill: bad), and is" nil)))) (cons "fully meaningful to the human superorganism; it is the clinical usage, which counts a mind as ill for" (cons "deviating from a population norm, that redefines the word (Avik, 2026-11-14 20:10 UTC). Empathic reasoning is learnable, by induction on free will from conception, and the world's" (cons "population operates far below its capacity, as it does mathematically (children will be fluent in" (cons "calculus by kindergarten). The human superorganism is in its infancy, and these are apoptotic" (cons "growing pains. A group that self-identifies as a group, not simply a belief, can be the subject of" (cons "statements distinct from statements about every member. Debating the contents of people's religions" (cons "is how they learn their own religion: a means of connection and growth. He has bipolar" (cons "capacity, is superhuman on various axes, and understands that everyone can be. He has been happy and" (cons "healthy for years and strongly identifies so: happy, at peace, purposeful and grateful as his" (cons "standard mode. He reached a state of higher mental health by intentional activity of the mind and," (cons "more critically, the intentional experience of emotion. Variant mental operation is the opportunity" (cons "of a greater density of experience, to be lived well, in a world that does not respect or nourish" (cons "it and does great harm to others given it. Being disinhibited from speaking is the only pathway to" (cons "truth. Variant cognition is part of the subject of" (cons "the work, not outside it." (cons "" (cons "**The aim is not a programming language.** It is the proper form of the internet and of global" (cons "computation, dissolving what is distasteful at every layer:" (cons "- UX;" (cons "- networking;" (cons "- application boundaries;" (cons "- data ownership;" (cons "- the malleability of software;" (cons "- the economics of development." (cons "" (cons "The language came out of solving that problem first: data, code and interaction all the way down." (cons "" (cons "**The motive is pedagogy and agency.** Any child can master AP calculus by ten, with the curriculum" (cons "inverted, and that world is straightforward to build within Avik's lifetime. A decade of using" (cons "screens while knowing how every system could be better is the source: friction to agency and" (cons "curiosity is the pain." (cons "" (cons "**The trajectory.**" (cons "- The product for information work becomes the operating system: a decentralized global operating" (cons "  system, the Hyperactive kernel on nearly every machine while Avik is in his twenties." (cons "- Scope can blow up to infinity, since nearly everything can be done better, so the order of work is" (cons "  chosen to collapse the timelines up front. A well-chosen first step halves the remaining time." (cons "" nil)))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))))
